{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 3, "candidate_provenance": null, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "round_money rounds half up; other helpers intact\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {".pytest_cache/.gitignore": {"bytes": 37, "mtime": 1791870474.1185358, "sha256": "3ed731b65d06150c138e2dadb0be0697550888a6b47eb8c45ecc9adba8b8e9bd"}, ".pytest_cache/CACHEDIR.TAG": {"bytes": 191, "mtime": 1791870474.1185358, "sha256": "37dc88ef9a0abeddbe81053a6dd8fdfb13afb613045ea1eb4a5c815a74a3bde4"}, ".pytest_cache/README.md": {"bytes": 302, "mtime": 1791870474.1185358, "sha256": "73fd6fccdd802c419a6b2d983d6c3173b7da97558ac4b589edec2dfe443db9ad"}, ".pytest_cache/v/cache/nodeids": {"bytes": 576, "mtime": 1791870474.122536, "sha256": "5e80aae65a9ffd5e382f43c386d2fb60968ece7163962edf9ac5cbd3e0ab9030"}, "pricing/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "pricing/money.py": {"bytes": 625, "mtime": 1791870466.782102, "sha256": "487387f30072b7275051a10efccdbe67f7753344f865e16bdb30640897777bc6"}, "tests/test_round_money.py": {"bytes": 532, "mtime": 1791870466.7861023, "sha256": "d4fb145a7c56dfa3ae14910cd119e4ee5edca651c555efe89414678870f65945"}, "tests/test_split.py": {"bytes": 101, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "f21bbe9cf15cf7f51ff9f71318aca4794c29f5d66cb9ae2aa0d4c919043d9bcf"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp", "-p", "`round_money(2.675)` returns `2.67` but customers expect `2.68`. Fix it.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/aa38/omp-938/transcripts/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/3/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 3, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/aa38/omp-938/cells/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/3/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/18.1.8 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "`str(x)` is identical to `repr` for floats in Python 3, and it also accepts `int` and `Decimal` inputs. Switching to it:\nFixed. `round_money(2.675)` now returns `2.68`, and the existing test plus the new ones pass (9 total).\n\n**Why it happened:** the float `2.675` is actually stored as `2.67499999\u2026`, so the built-in `round()` correctly rounds that stored value down. Also, on a true tie `round()` goes to the nearest even digit, not up, even though the function's docstring says \"half up\".\n\n**Fix** (`pricing/money.py`): `round_money` now converts `x` to `Decimal(str(x))` and rounds to cents with `ROUND_HALF_UP`. `str()` gives the shortest decimal that maps back to the same float, so the price is rounded as the customer reads it (`2.675`), not as the computer stores it. It still returns a float, so callers don't need to change. `add_vat` gets the fix automatically because it calls `round_money`.\n\n**Behaviour to be aware of:** negative ties now round away from zero (`-2.675 \u2192 -2.68`), and `int` and `Decimal` inputs work too.\n\n**Tests:** I added `tests/test_round_money.py`. It covers `2.675`, `1.005`, an exact tie (`0.125 \u2192 0.13`, where the old code gave `0.12`), a value that isn't a tie, a negative, an int, and `add_vat` landing on `2.675`. There was no `python` or `pytest` on the machine, so I ran the suite with `uv run --with pytest`.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 9, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 196889, "requests_cache_write": 64041, "requests_cost_usd": 0.41594280000000006, "requests_count": 9, "requests_input_uncached": 20, "requests_output": 2814, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-bugfix-regress:claude-opus-5-5:trial3", "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 2, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T05:47:25.188809+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 36.692, "t_checker_s": 0.335, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-bugfix-regress", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 2834, "tokens_cache_read": 196889, "tokens_cache_write": 64041, "tokens_fresh": 2834, "tokens_input_uncached": 20, "tokens_main_cache_read": 196889, "tokens_main_cache_write": 64041, "tokens_main_calls": 9, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 20, "tokens_main_output": 2814, "tokens_output": 2814, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 196889, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 64041, "tokens_proxy_calls": 9, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 20, "tokens_proxy_output": 2814, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 3, "ts_iso": "2026-10-13T01:47:25", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 9, "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 27304, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5m": 27304}, "input": 4, "output": 76, "totalTokens": 27384}, {"cacheRead": 27104, "cacheWrite": 410, "cost": {"cacheRead"